            <ArticleTitle>[Headache and inflammations in the mandibular region (author's transl)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1957-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Based on four cases, the necessity of a thorough clinical and X-ray examination of the entire set of teeth is demonstrated, since all four patients showed multiple focal lesions. It is emphasised that focal findings of this kind can always be the only or additional causes for pain syndromes in the head.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
